{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_title", "source_sha256": "bae0016f018c3799bcaea2164af6cef8cdc27bb47a10997ffa058d438819fab8", "ja": "歌織とおでかけ2", "zh": "和歌织出游2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "179b949137c6a90802d0be25bd3df3c363a059b3642bbb7c97aa59961c64ef95", "ja": "歌織とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和歌织外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1aee6b4249803539049f14992e7b9643b6914f636830398182e037e3fe4332ea", "ja": "これが土佐の市場か……見渡す限り\n露店が軒を連ねていて、壮観ですね！", "zh": "这就是土佐的集市吗……放眼望去，摊位鳞次栉比，真是壮观啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "a0a7b4be83d12c5eb603b11bd290b0ce9af7485b142c8eab1381f92ec998ef54", "ja": "ここは、日曜日だけ開かれる市場なんだそうです。\nいろいろなものが売られていて……。", "zh": "听说这里是只在星期日开放的市场。\n各种各样的东西都有卖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "e84d5a458b3148ea776dec34d91609d60534fef16b9ca32d9d65de02c1e41d22", "ja": "なにより、活気がすごいですね。\n圧倒されてしまいそう……。", "zh": "最重要的是，这里的活力真是惊人。\n感觉都快要被这股气势压倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ca54681fcb566be34cd87644f339acda2388cd80fd02511702ccdd9b07e8ff6b", "ja": "市場ですから、自然と人も集まりますし。\nにぎやかですよね。", "zh": "毕竟是市场，人自然就会聚集过来。\n真的很热闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "d905862050518fbd72fcb771dc8ac8db2ed3ede104d9b680c680c7546c417d2f", "ja": "はい。本当ににぎやかで……ふふっ♪", "zh": "是的。真的很热闹……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "51d2f526a776162d35ed38c3ce2781f9c5630fd9eb104d150ab6a264ad555aea", "ja": "歌織さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐，您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "cd49caa60739129aeb78fa437e2b91cd96ba004144e568416ca28f7d7ff1db5d", "ja": "あっ、すみません。私、こういう\n市場を覗いたりするのも、初めてで……。", "zh": "啊，对不起。我还是第一次逛这种市场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "63d666d762d8a4bb1a6d2102e2fc019d37079fff4354ce43c325b0117825b5e3", "ja": "なんだか楽しくなってきてしまって……\n浮き足立ってるみたいです。ふふっ。", "zh": "不知不觉变得越来越开心了……\n好像有点兴奋过头了。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b02b5814694fbf4debd7d5ed490659d1292d702a430ca1cfdbd136273c92061c", "ja": "そうだったんですね。なら今くらいは、\n仕事を忘れて思いっきり楽しみましょう！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。那至少现在，就暂时忘掉工作，尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao02_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3851e8e34701b50f77ff72eb756bcf3e7e8f4e2abbc0c59057607f89e3db1c8", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん、\n歌織に、いろいろ教えてくださいね♪", "zh": "好的！{$P$}先生，请教教歌织各种事情吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
